eCell","children":[{"type":"inlineCode","value":"defaultOptions.mutations?"}]},{"type":"tableCell","children":[{"type":"link","href":"MutationOptions.md","children":[{"type":"inlineCode","value":"MutationOptions"}]},{"type":"text","value":"<"},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"unknown"},{"type":"text","value":", "},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"Error"},{"type":"text","value":", "},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"unknown"},{"type":"text","value":", "},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"unknown"},{"type":"text","value":">"}]},{"type":"tableCell","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Default options merged into every mutation restored from the dehydrated state."}]}],[{"type":"tableCell","children":[{"type":"inlineCode","value":"defaultOptions.queries?"}]},{"type":"tableCell","children":[{"type":"link","href":"QueryOptions.md","children":[{"type":"inlineCode","value":"QueryOptions"}]},{"type":"text","value":"<"},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"unknown"},{"type":"text","value":", "},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"Error"},{"type":"text","value":", "},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"unknown"},{"type":"text","value":", readonly "},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"unknown"},{"type":"text","value":"[], "},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"never"},{"type":"text","value":">"}]},{"type":"tableCell","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Default options merged into every query restored from the dehydrated state."}]}]]}],"headings":[{"id":"properties","text":"Properties","level":2}]},"frameworks":[],"downloadMarkdown":"\nDefined in: [packages/query-core/src/hydration.ts:68](https://github.com/TanStack/query/blob/main/packages/query-core/src/hydration.ts#L68)\n\nOptions for `hydrate`, controlling the default options applied to queries/mutations restored from a\n`DehydratedState`, and how to reverse any transformation applied by `DehydrateOptions.serializeData`.\n\n## Properties\n\n| Property | Type | Description |\n| ------ | ------ | ------ |\n| <a id=\"property-defaultoptions\"></a> `defaultOptions?` | `object` | Options applied to the queries and mutations restored from the dehydrated state. |\n| `defaultOptions.deserializeData?` | `TransformerFn` | Transforms a query's `data` after it is read from the dehydrated state, reversing `serializeData`. |\n| `defaultOptions.mutations?` | [`MutationOptions`](MutationOptions.md)\\<`unknown`, `Error`, `unknown`, `unknown`\\> | Default options merged into every mutation restored from the dehydrated state. |\n| `defaultOptions.queries?` | [`QueryOptions`](QueryOptions.md)\\<`unknown`, `Error`, `unknown`, readonly `unknown`[], `never`\\> | Default options merged into every query restored from the dehydrated state. |\n","originalRawMarkdown":"---\nid: HydrateOptions\ntitle: HydrateOptions\n---\n\nDefined in: [packages/query-core/src/hydration.ts:68](https://github.com/TanStack/query/blob/main/packages/query-core/src/hydration.ts#L68)\n\nOptions for `hydrate`, controlling the default options applied to queries/mutations restored from a\n`DehydratedState`, and how to reverse any transformation applied by `DehydrateOptions.serializeData`.\n\n## Properties\n\n| Property | Type | Description |\n| ------ | ------ | ------ |\n| <a id=\"property-defaultoptions\"></a> `defaultOptions?` | `object` | Options applied to the queries and mutations restored from the dehydrated state. |\n| `defaultOptions.deserializeData?` | `TransformerFn` | Transforms a query's `data` after it is read from the dehydrated state, reversing `serializeData`. |\n| `defaultOptions.mutations?` | [`MutationOptions`](MutationOptions.md)\\<`unknown`, `Error`, `unknown`, `unknown`\\> | Default options merged into every mutation restored from the dehydrated state. |\n| `defaultOptions.queries?` | [`QueryOptions`](QueryOptions.md)\\<`unknown`, `Error`, `unknown`, readonly `unknown`[], `never`\\> | Default options merged into every query restored from the dehydrated state. |\n"}
